Challenge in the present writ petition, filed under Articles 226/227 of the Constitution of India,
for the third time, is to the acquisition proceedings initiated on 17.09.2004 (Annexure P-7) issued under Section 4 of the Land Acquisition Act, 1894 (for short, the 'Act') read with Section 17(2)(c) of the Act whereby the land was sought to be acquired for Villages Nabada Fatehpur, Naurangpur,
Manesar, Lakhnoula, Naharpur Kasan and Shikopur, Tehsil & District Gurugram.
